[3.883775, "o", "\u001b[33mff297cc\u001b[m Serve a password-gated hosted Solana RPC so developers need no provider\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m9444513\u001b[m Allow bounded VM execution time in hosted interaction tests\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m66e5ba7\u001b[m Record live workspace routing on eplyx.dev\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33md749e9b\u001b[m Keep Pages previews on the explicit same-origin API\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m586d5c0\u001b[m Serve workspace and API through eplyx.dev\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m4a2d723\u001b[m Record verified API access from Eplyx domains\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m9985a7a\u001b[m Record live Cloudflare domains and deployment verification\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m3c8965f\u001b[m Verify Pages routing and publish the domain contact address\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m87a7348\u001b[m Configure Cloudflare Pages hosting for eplyx.dev\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mdea95d2\u001b[m Add explicit ProgramData preparation to the rollout rehearsal (Step 16B)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m0e90d79\u001b[m Add bounded program-upgrade rollout rehearsal (Step 16A)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m6361faa\u001b[m Run the public tier in GitHub CI and the full suite with make regression\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mb53734b\u001b[m Write the lifecycle asset line into the CI text report\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m08cc181\u001b[m Add regression CI, guided first check, PR comments, ops view and joint restore\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m9c61e32\u001b[m Split the server API and the eplyx CLI into modules by responsibility\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m38ea36c\u001b[m Harden storage, sign-in, static serving and navigation from the 11A review\u001b[m\r\n"]
